<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n65691" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μειδ-άω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>smile</i>, 
				Ep.
			 Verb, only 3sg.
			aor.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μείδησε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					1.595
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				5.426
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				4.609
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Sc.</u>
				115
			</span></i>, etc.; part.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μειδήσας, -σασα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					1.596
				</span></i>
			, etc.; inf.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μειδῆσαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>h.Cer.</u>
					204
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μείδησε σαρδάνιον</span> (v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Σαρδάνιος</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				20.301
			</span></i>; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γελᾶν</span>, <i>laugh
				aloud</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μειδῆσαι γελάσαι τε</span>
			<u>h.Cer.</u>l.c.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάρχαρόν τι
				μειδήσας</span>
			<i>grinning</i> so as to show his teeth, <i><span class="en">
				Babr.
				94.6
			</span></i>:—pres. is supplied by <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μειδιάω</span></b> , used by <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i> only in 
				Ep.
			
			part.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μειδιόων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					7.212
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				23.786
			</span></i>; -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ιόωσα</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				21.491
			</span></i>: later 3sg.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μειδιάει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>h.Hom.</u>
					10.3
				</span></i>
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μειδιᾷ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Theoc.
					30.5
				</span></i>
			; part.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μειδιάων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>h.Hom.</u>
					7.14
				</span></i>
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μειδιῶσα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Th.</u>
					513
				</span></i>
			; inf.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μειδιᾶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Prm.</u>
					130a
				</span></i>
			: impf.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμειδία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>DMeretr.</u>
					3.2
				</span></i>
			; 
				Ep.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μειδιάασκε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PLit.Lond.</u>
					41
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Q.S.
				9.117
			</span></i>: aor. I 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμειδίᾱσα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.172b
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>DDeor.</u>
				20.11
			</span></i>; inf.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μειδιᾶσαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Apollod.
					1.5.3
				</span></i>
			; part.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μειδιάσας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Phd.</u>
					86d
				</span></i>
			; 
				Aeol.
			 fem. -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ιάσαισα</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Sapph.
				1.14
			</span></i>. (Cf. Skt. <i>smáyati</i>, Lett.
				<i>smaidīt</i> 'smile', etc.)</div>
